{"strongs": "H8328", "word": "שֹׁ֫רֶשׁ", "translit": "she.resh", "root": "שרש", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "root", "definition": "שֹׁ֫רֶשׁ noun masculine Deut 29:17 root ; — ׳ שׁ absolute Deut 29:17 +, construct Isa 11:10 +; suffix שָׁרְשִׁי Job 29:19 , etc.; plural construct שָׁרְשֵׁי Job 13:27 (see below) Job 36:31 0, suffix שָֽׁרָשָׁיו Amos 2:9 +, שָֽׁרָשֶׁיהָ Ezek 17:7 +; — 1. root of people under figure of tree, involving firmness, permanence, Amos 2:9 ; Hos 9:16 ; Hos 14:6 ; Isa 14:30 ; 2Kgs 19:30 = Isa 37:31 — שָׁרְשָׁם Judg 5:14 is probably corrupt, see GFM ; — so of person (compare Phoenician, Eshmunazar 11 GACooke pp. 30, 36 ) Isa 5:24 ; Mal 3:19 ; Job 8:17 ; Job 18:16 ; Job 29:19 ; Prov 12:3 ; Prov 12:12 = stock, family Isa 11:1 ; Isa 11:10 ; Dan 11:7 , compare (of serpent) Isa 14:29 = source or cause Deut 29:17 , דָּבָר ׳ שׁ Job 19:28 . 2. literally root of tree or shrub Jer 17:8 (simile), Ezek 31:7 (metaphor of people). Isa 53:2 (simile), Job 14:8 ; Job 30:4 of vine (metaphor of people) Ezek 17:6 ; Ezek 17:7 ; Ezek 17:9 (twice in verse); Ps 80:10 (accusative of congnate meaning with verb with שׁרשׁ Hiph`il ). 3. root , figurative=lowest stratum, of mountain Job 28:9 , of sea Job 36:30 = bottom (text strange and dubious: Du רָאשֵׁי הָרִים , with אֵרוֺ in v a ); of feet, שָׁרְשֵׁי רַגְלַי Job 13:27 , i.e. soles Ew Di De Da and others (elsewhere כַּף ), Bu place of treading, footholds ; Du (arbitrarily) שָׁרְשִׁי , strike out רגלי .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9058')\">BDB9058</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8328')\">H8328</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9057')\">BDB9057</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9059')\">BDB9059</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שֹׁ֫רֶשׁ</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Deut 29:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,29,17)\">Deut 29:17</ref></sup> <highlightword>root</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Deut 29:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,29,17)\">Deut 29:17</ref> +, construct <ref ref=\"Isa 11:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,10)\">Isa 11:10</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>שָׁרְשִׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 29:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,29,19)\">Job 29:19</ref>, etc.; plural construct <bdbheb>שָׁרְשֵׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 13:27\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,27)\">Job 13:27</ref> (see below) <ref ref=\"Job 36:31\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,31)\">Job 36:31</ref>0, suffix <bdbheb>שָֽׁרָשָׁיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 2:9\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,9)\">Amos 2:9</ref> +, <bdbheb>שָֽׁרָשֶׁיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,7)\">Ezek 17:7</ref> +; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>root</highlight> of people under figure of tree, involving firmness, permanence, <ref ref=\"Amos 2:9\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,9)\">Amos 2:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 9:16\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(28,9,16)\">Hos 9:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 14:6\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(28,14,6)\">Hos 14:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 14:30\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,30)\">Isa 14:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 19:30\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(12,19,30)\">2Kgs 19:30</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 37:31\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(23,37,31)\">Isa 37:31</ref> — <bdbheb>שָׁרְשָׁם</