in=\"28\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,28)\">Job 19:28</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> literally <highlight>root</highlight> of tree or shrub <ref ref=\"Jer 17:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,8)\">Jer 17:8</ref> (simile), <ref ref=\"Ezek 31:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,31,7)\">Ezek 31:7</ref> (metaphor of people). <ref ref=\"Isa 53:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"53\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"53\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,53,2)\">Isa 53:2</ref> (simile), <ref ref=\"Job 14:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,14,8)\">Job 14:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 30:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,4)\">Job 30:4</ref> of vine (metaphor of people) <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,6)\">Ezek 17:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,7)\">Ezek 17:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,9)\">Ezek 17:9</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Ps 80:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"80\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"80\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,80,10)\">Ps 80:10</ref> (accusative of congnate meaning with verb with <bdbheb>שׁרשׁ</bdbheb> <b>Hiph`il</b>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>root</highlight>, figurative=lowest stratum, of mountain <ref ref=\"Job 28:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,9)\">Job 28:9</ref>, of sea <ref ref=\"Job 36:30\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,30)\">Job 36:30</ref>= bottom (text strange and dubious: <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup> <bdbheb>רָאשֵׁי הָרִים</bdbheb>, with <bdbheb>אֵרוֺ</bdbheb> in v<sup>a</sup>); of feet, <bdbheb>שָׁרְשֵׁי רַגְלַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 13:27\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,27)\">Job 13:27</ref>, i.e. soles <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Da')\">Da</lookup> and others (elsewhere <bdbheb>כַּף</bdbheb>), <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup> place of treading, <highlight>footholds</highlight>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup> (arbitrarily) <bdbheb>שָׁרְשִׁי</bdbheb>, strike out <bdbheb>רגלי</bdbheb>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Deut 29:17", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 29, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Isa 11:10", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 11, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Job 29:19", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 29, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Job 13:27", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 13, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Job 36:31", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 36, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Amos 2:9", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 2, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ezek 17:7", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 17, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Hos 9:16", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 9, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Hos 14:6", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 14, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Isa 14:30", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "2Kgs 19:30", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 19, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "Isa 37:31", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 37, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Judg 5:14", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 5, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Isa 5:24", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Mal 3:19", "book": "MAL", "chapter": 3, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Job 8:17", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 8, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Job 18:16", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 18, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Prov 12:3", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Prov 12:12", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Isa 11:1", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 11, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Dan 11:7", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 11, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 14:29", "boo